NAME = 'KLV: Klingon Language Version of the World English Bible'
BOOK = 'Obadiah'

CHAPTERS = {
    1: {
        1: "The leghtaHghach vo' Obadiah. vam ghaH nuq the joH joH'a' jatlhtaH about Edom. maH ghaj Qoyta' news vo' joH'a', je an ambassador ghaH ngeHta' among the tuqpu', ja'ta', “Hu', je let's Hu' Dung Daq Daj Daq may'.",
        2: "yIlegh, jIH ghaj chenmoHta' SoH mach among the tuqpu'. SoH 'oH greatly muSqu'.",
        3: "The pride vo' lIj tIq ghajtaH deceived SoH, SoH 'Iv yIn Daq the clefts vo' the nagh, 'Iv juH ghaH jen, 'Iv jatlhtaH Daq Daj tIq, ‘'Iv DichDaq qem jIH bIng Daq the yav?'",
        4: "'a' SoH mount Daq jen as the eagle, je 'a' lIj nest ghaH cher among the stars, jIH DichDaq qem SoH bIng vo' pa',” jatlhtaH joH'a'.",
        5: "“chugh HejwI'pu' ghoSta' Daq SoH, chugh robbers Sum ram—oh, nuq disaster awaits SoH—wouldn't chaH neH steal until chaH ghajta' yap? chugh grape pickers ghoSta' Daq SoH, wouldn't chaH mej 'op gleaning grapes?",
        6: "chay' Esau DichDaq taH ransacked! chay' Daj hidden treasures 'oH nejta' pa'!",
        7: "Hoch the loDpu' vo' lIj alliance ghaj qempu' SoH Daq lIj way, 'ach Daq the veH. The loDpu' 'Iv were Daq roj tlhej SoH ghaj deceived SoH, je prevailed Daq SoH. Friends 'Iv Sop lIj tIr Soj lay a tojta'ghach bIng SoH. pa' ghaH ghobe' yajtaHghach Daq ghaH.”",
        8: "“Won't jIH Daq vetlh jaj,” jatlhtaH joH'a', “Qaw' the val loDpu' pa' vo' Edom, je yajtaHghach pa' vo' the HuD vo' Esau?",
        9: "lIj HoS loDpu', Teman, DichDaq taH dismayed, Daq the pItlh vetlh Hoch may taH pe' litHa' vo' the HuD vo' Esau Sum HoHqu'.",
        10: "vaD the violence ta'pu' Daq lIj loDnI' Jacob, tuH DichDaq So' SoH, je SoH DichDaq taH pe' litHa' reH.",
        11: "Daq the jaj vetlh SoH Qampu' Daq the latlh retlh, Daq the jaj vetlh novpu' qengta' DoH Daj substance, je foreigners 'elta' Daq Daj lojmItmey, je chuH lots vaD Jerusalem, 'ach SoH were rur wa' vo' chaH.",
        12: "'ach yImev legh bIng Daq lIj loDnI' Daq the jaj vo' Daj disaster, je yImev yItIv Dung the puqpu' vo' Judah Daq the jaj vo' chaj QIH. yImev jatlh proudly Daq the jaj vo' distress.",
        13: "yImev 'el Daq the lojmIt vo' wIj ghotpu Daq the jaj vo' chaj calamity. yImev legh bIng Daq chaj affliction Daq the jaj vo' chaj calamity, ghobe' seize chaj wealth Daq the jaj vo' chaj calamity.",
        14: "yImev Qam Daq the crossroads Daq pe' litHa' chaH vo' Daj 'Iv escape. yImev toD Dung chaH vo' Daj 'Iv remain Daq the jaj vo' distress.",
        15: "vaD the jaj vo' joH'a' ghaH Sum Hoch the tuqpu'! As SoH ghaj ta'pu', 'oH DichDaq taH ta'pu' Daq SoH. lIj deeds DichDaq chegh upon lIj ghaj nach.",
        16: "vaD as SoH ghaj drunk Daq wIj le' HuD, vaj DichDaq Hoch the tuqpu' tlhutlh continually. HIja', chaH DichDaq tlhutlh, swallow bIng, je DichDaq taH as 'a' chaH ghajta' ghobe' taH.",
        17: "'ach Daq Mount Zion, pa' DichDaq taH chaH 'Iv escape, je 'oH DichDaq taH le'. The tuq vo' Jacob DichDaq ghaj chaj possessions.",
        18: "The tuq vo' Jacob DichDaq taH a qul, the tuq vo' Joseph a flame, je the tuq vo' Esau vaD stubble. chaH DichDaq meQ among chaH, je Sop chaH. pa' DichDaq ghobe' taH vay' remaining Daq the tuq vo' Esau.” Indeed, joH'a' ghajtaH jatlhpu'.",
        19: "chaH vo' the pemHov poS DichDaq ghaj the HuD vo' Esau, je chaH vo' the lowland, the Philistines. chaH DichDaq ghaj the yotlh vo' Ephraim, je the yotlh vo' Samaria. Benjamin DichDaq ghaj Gilead.",
        20: "The captives vo' vam army vo' the puqpu' vo' Israel, 'Iv 'oH among the Canaanites, DichDaq ghaj 'ach Daq Zarephath; je the captives vo' Jerusalem, 'Iv 'oH Daq Sepharad, DichDaq ghaj the vengmey vo' the Negev.",
        21: "Saviors DichDaq jaH Dung Daq Mount Zion Daq noH the Hudmey vo' Esau, je the kingdom DichDaq taH joH'a'.",
    },
}
